      "id": "shopify-section-template--21565161570358__philosophy",
      "classes": "shopify-section",
      "y": 1000,
      "height": 1080.484375,
      "text": "PHILOSOPHY\nFELT, NOT SEEN\n\nSome things reveal their value quietly.\nWhen everything outside the piece itself falls away, what remains is the warmth of the leather, the balance of its form, and the care that went into making it.\nAs it settles into your life, its meaning becomes uniquely yours.\nIts value is not fixed at the moment of purchase. It is shaped by the years that follow.",
