      "classes": "shopify-section",
      "y": 2833.609375,
      "height": 319.109375,
      "text": "ATELIER\nQUIET DIALOGUE\n\nEvery piece begins with a quiet exchange between the leather and the artisan.\n\nWe work with the leather\u2019s natural character, shaping each piece with care and precision.\n\nWhat emerges is a series of enduring forms that stay with you through every stage of your life.",
